{#- Dessert fridge sign (client 2026-10-29): black & white, no logo, the
    desserts listed one to a line with their price. The list is
    `fridgeDesserts` above, typed by hand: the kinds change with each
    batch and live only in Square (kitchen board, Manage -> Desserts), so
    change the list when the batch does, build, print. Every fridge
    dessert is one price since that day, Cheesecake's in menu.json; a
    dessert added from Manage -> Desserts is set to it in Square. If you
    find yourself typing a price here, stop. The magic bars and rice
    crispy treats are on sign-dessert-bars-bw.njk. -#}
{%- set desserts = (menu.categories | where("id", "desserts"))[0] %}
{%- set fridge = (desserts.items | where("name", "Cheesecake"))[0] %}
<div class="canvas sign sign--bw fd">
    <div class="sign-heading">
        <h2 class="p-display sign-heading-title">Desserts</h2>
    </div>

    {%- if fridge %}
    <ul class="sign-rows fd-rows">
        {%- for i in fridgeDesserts %}
        <li class="sign-row">
            <div class="sign-row-head">
                <span class="sign-row-name">{{ i.name }}</span>
                <span class="sign-row-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="sign-row-price">{{ fridge.price | money }}</span>
            </div>
            {%- if i.sub %}
            <p class="sign-row-sub">{{ i.sub }}</p>
            {%- endif %}
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- endif %}
</div>
